title: "Zebrafish heart-injury scRNA-seq meta-analysis: analysis code and processed data"
abstract: "Analysis code, processed data, figures and tables for a meta-analysis integrating three public zebrafish (Danio rerio) cardiac-injury single-cell RNA-seq datasets (GSE227190, GSE159032, GSE262689) into a 77,375-cell, 26-cluster atlas of injury-response programs."
